    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.poster.avif?t=1753451898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.webm?t=1753451898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.mp4?t=1753451898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Discover the origins of I Am Your President story by playing as a protagonist\u2019s predecessor!<br><br><strong>I Am Your President: Prologue</strong> is a free game that includes features available in the full version. Play this narrative strategy simulator in order to experience an engaging story with branching dialogues and different endings. Use the right strategy to win the election and if you fail, you can always get a second chance! <br><br>Simply put, become the President of the United States and decide on the fate of the seven billion people by making some difficult choices. Can you rise to the challenge?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In order to make it work, you will have to</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Make yourself comfortable in the Oval Office and let the story unfold.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Select dialogue options that suit you best and watch them affect the statistics. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Wisely choose your advisors and cabinet members. Hire and fire on a daily basis.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Decide upon the way of ruling and embrace consequences \u2013 your decisions matter!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> React to the events on the world map and choose the best way to resolve the conflict. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Use social media and read the news \u2013 maybe this time they wrote something nice?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Choose your path and replay the game to see other outcomes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Provide sustainable development, or simply watch your country fall into chaos.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.poster.avif?t=1753451898\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.webm?t=1753451898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/5538486c101fa8f63fe277b959df5152.mp4?t=1753451898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Discover the origins of I Am Your President story by playing as a protagonist\u2019s predecessor!<br><br><strong>I Am Your President: Prologue</strong> is a free game that includes features available in the full version. Play this narrative strategy simulator in order to experience an engaging story with branching dialogues and different endings. Use the right strategy to win the election and if you fail, you can always get a second chance! <br><br>Simply put, become the President of the United States and decide on the fate of the seven billion people by making some difficult choices. Can you rise to the challenge?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In order to make it work, you will have to</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Make yourself comfortable in the Oval Office and let the story unfold.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Select dialogue options that suit you best and watch them affect the statistics. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Wisely choose your advisors and cabinet members. Hire and fire on a daily basis.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Decide upon the way of ruling and embrace consequences \u2013 your decisions matter!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> React to the events on the world map and choose the best way to resolve the conflict. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Use social media and read the news \u2013 maybe this time they wrote something nice?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Choose your path and replay the game to see other outcomes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201330/extras/6e8fafc88577f93cf3c866b028e33b7e.webp?t=1753451898\" /></div> Provide sustainable development, or simply watch your country fall into chaos.",
